                <pb facs="0287" n="187" sameAs="frus:frus1920v03/pg187"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">812.00/24669: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Mexico</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Hanna</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-10-06T15:00:00-06:36"><hi rendition="#italic">October 6,
                                1920—3 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 11:07
                    p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>410. Foreign Office confirms local press reports of today that Honduras and
                    Salvador have recognized the Mexican Government.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hanna</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
